    Separate from `no_test_link` on purpose: that one is the ACTUATOR and files the application on
    the spot. The re-open sweep is a hand that goes to look, and a look that sends an application
    under his name is the exact failure the sweep's own guard comment warns about one screen up."""
    if _probe is not None:
